window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Can one small group survive hostile enemies in a treacherous land?</b><br> <br> Waking broken and bloody, a woman finds herself lost, terrified, and alone. Stripped of everything–no possessions, no memory–she relies on instinct to survive.<br> <br> Larron of the Derou elves travels with a small messenger party to deliver an urgent message to his kin in the east. Along the way, they rescue a woman under attack by a pack of vicious insectoid creatures, only to discover she is more than she first seems.<br> <br> Cautiously joining forces, they must overcome hazardous terrain, predators, and enemy attacks to reach their allies. Will their combined skill be enough?<br> <i> <br> Hidden Memory</i> is an action-packed fantasy adventure, kicking off the Hidden Series. Welcome to the realm of Elaria, where elves and fairy battle for survival against forces seeking to destroy them. If you enjoy fantastic quests, a great cast of characters, and a world with magic and mysteries unfolding, this series is for you!</p>"; 
